{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut down hordes of enemies <strong>automatically</strong> in <strong>Nomad Idle</strong>, a spin-off of <i>Nomad Survival</i>. Engage in an expansive storyline, make impactful decisions, and grow stronger through various gameplay features that gradually unlock as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/ni_gif1.gif?t=1739726275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nomad Idle</strong> is an idle game with a defined end and is not designed to be endless. However, that does not mean the game is short or lacks depth. In <strong>Nomad Idle</strong>, you can expect to have access to the following as you play through the game and unlock more features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Level up and earn Stat Points</strong> which may be distributed within 7 unique Stats, allowing you to create a build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Discover, craft, and upgrade Equipment</strong> in order to make yourself stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Conjure Summons</strong> to aid you in battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Select Passive Skills to be automatically used in battle</strong>, further defining your build. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Choose a Character,</strong> defining your active abilities and special perks for your playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/ni_gif2.gif?t=1739726275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nomad Idle</strong> is an <strong>idle game</strong>, meaning that it mostly <strong>plays on its own</strong>. Your character moves and attacks enemies all on their own, but it <strong>can be played actively</strong> by making use of character-specific skills and abilities. Playing actively in this way is <strong>entirely optional</strong> and not mandatory, but can be effective in speeding up your progress or help you overcome challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3042190?t=1739726275","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739726275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739726275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739726275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3488310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut down hordes of enemies <strong>automatically</strong> in <strong>Nomad Idle</strong>, a spin-off of <i>Nomad Survival</i>. Engage in an expansive storyline, make impactful decisions, and grow stronger through various gameplay features that gradually unlock as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/ni_gif1.gif?t=1739726275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nomad Idle</strong> is an idle game with a defined end and is not designed to be endless. However, that does not mean the game is short or lacks depth. In <strong>Nomad Idle</strong>, you can expect to have access to the following as you play through the game and unlock more features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Level up and earn Stat Points</strong> which may be distributed within 7 unique Stats, allowing you to create a build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Discover, craft, and upgrade Equipment</strong> in order to make yourself stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Conjure Summons</strong> to aid you in battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Select Passive Skills to be automatically used in battle</strong>, further defining your build. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Choose a Character,</strong> defining your active abilities and special perks for your playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/extras/ni_gif2.gif?t=1739726275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nomad Idle</strong> is an <strong>idle game</strong>, meaning that it mostly <strong>plays on its own</strong>. Your character moves and attacks enemies all on their own, but it <strong>can be played actively</strong> by making use of character-specific skills and abilities. Playing actively in this way is <strong>entirely optional</strong> and not mandatory, but can be effective in speeding up your progress or help you overcome challenges.</p>","developers":["The Fox Knocks"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042190/header.jpg?t=1739726275","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257074600,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074600/movie480.mp4?t=1731931312","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074600/movie_max.mp4?t=1731931312"},"name":"Nomad Idle Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257074600/bebefce0ae2c01a73ef642e09c936ff16079f022/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731931312","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074600/movie480_vp9.webm?t=17319313